flowchart LR
    U[User / Windows UI] --> UI[Native Rust egui Widgets]
    UI --> D[DoofusDock canonical LayoutDocument / Service]
    UI --> R[Pure Rust Redux-like state reducers]
    R --> G[Typed Hermes Gateway JSON-RPC Adapter]
    R --> H[Typed Doofus Bridge API Client]
    G <--> P[Existing Hermes Python Runtime / TUI Gateway]
    H <--> T[Existing Doofus Truth Layer]
    P --> TOOLS[Models / tools / sessions / subagents / MCP]
    T --> AUDIT[Requirements / Evidence / Vault metadata / Events]
    UI --> OS[Windows host: PTY / Native windows / Accessibility]
    D --> STORE[Canonical layouts + revisioned history]
    R --> APPSTATE[UI drafts and ephemeral view state]
    UI -.-> PLUGIN[Native plugin host or explicit sandbox compatibility]
